WEBVTT

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.030
Young master, do you have everything?

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.980
Yeah. I'm good.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:11.990
Young master, are you sure?

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.490
I've told you over and over.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.650
I don't need you to see me out.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.410
But it's quite dangerous these days.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:21.600
Besides...

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.520
I'll be okay. Really.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.990
Just watch the house for me, Lilith.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.070
But...

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.590
Got it?

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.700
Understood.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.030
Okay, I'll be going.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:37.650
Young master...

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.490
Your necktie is loose.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.370
Th-Thanks.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.070
There's dust on your shoe.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.820
Maybe the other outfit 
would have been better...

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:51.960
Your hair...

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:53.890
Your sleeves...

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.940
What's the matter, young master?

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:08.180
Are you so charmed by me that 
you don't want to go to school?

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:10.870
No... It's just that it's like we're married.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:15.850
My mom did the same things 
for my dad every day.

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:18.460
They were really lovey-dovey.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.490
L-Love-dovey?

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:28.640
Y-Young master, you're going 
to be late for school.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.740
Oh, right.

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:32.220
I'll see you later.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:37.910
Off you go.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:55.300
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:14.460
<b>Episode 3:     Gojouin Tsukasa Is Precocious</b>

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.390
Thank you, Fujisaki.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:35.730
Off you go, young lady.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.700
Yuuri-san...

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:47.740
<i>I heard from Fujisaki that 
his parents passed away.</i>

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.970
<i>He doesn't seem to have recovered.</i>

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.120
I'm late, thanks to Lilith.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.420
<i>I gave her my orders.</i>

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.690
<i>She should be all right.</i>

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.370
Hey, have you heard?

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:10.800
What?

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.210
Didn't you know?

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.940
His parents died in an accident.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.670
Seriously?

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.770
His servants all quit, too.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:23.180
So is he living on his own?

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.590
What's he going to do?

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:25.590
Dunno.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.720
I heard it's pretty bad.

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.540
I wonder if he can afford tuition.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.120
Hey, cut it out.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.410
Yeah. That's mean.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.970
<i>Yuuri-san...</i>

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.400
Good evening.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:50.050
G-Good evening.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.230
<i>There's a boy at my school, in my class,</i>

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.270
<i>that I remember for his honest eyes.</i>

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:02.860
<i>He spoke to me, even though 
I'm so timid and quiet.</i>

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.470
<i>It made me very happy.</i>

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.050
<i>Maybe it's presumptuous of me,</i>

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:13.590
<i>but if there's anything I can do, 
I'd like to help him.</i>

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.450
<i>Be brave, Tsukasa.</i>

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.950
U-Um, Yuuri-sa—

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.920
Okay, everyone. Take your seats, please.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.560
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:39.140
I wonder why the young 
master is so resistant.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:45.810
Is it because he doesn't trust 
my capabilities as a maid yet?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.700
No, I can't keep moping.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:57.670
I have to work hard so he'll 
accept me as soon as possible.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.920
Hey, where did you go for summer break?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.420
I went to my grandfather's vacation home.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.970
I went to the sea.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.130
I rode in a huge boat.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:13.310
Lucky.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.800
U-Um, Yuuri-san—

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.380
Did you go anywhere, Tsukasa-chan?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.500
Thank you for the meal.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:27.890
Tsukasa-chan?

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:36.600
I think dinner today will be Hamburg 
steaks, salad, and corn soup.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.770
Yeah, that'll do.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:42.030
Now, I just need to go 
pick up the young master.

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:47.880
<i>He may be upset with me, but as his maid,</i>

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.780
<i>welcoming him home is part of my job.</i>

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:56.390
Piano lessons at 3 PM.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.500
English at 5 PM.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.180
<i>Isn't that...</i>

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.200
See you tomorrow.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.110
Bye.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.130
Wait for me.

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:21.260
<i>I can get home by myself.</i>

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:23.620
<i>I don't need anyone to come take me home.</i>

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.730
Whoa, what a pretty maid.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.970
Which mansion is she from?

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.810
<i>Wh-Why is Lilith here?!</i>

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.440
<i>Did she come to pick me up?</i>

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:37.310
<i>I told her so many times 
not to come to my school!</i>

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.730
I never got a chance to talk to him.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.190
<i>Yuuri-san?</i>

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:50.620
<i>This is my chance!</i>

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.480
<i>Okay, be brave, Tsukasa!</i>

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.210
U-Um, Yuuri-san...

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:59.400
I've come to escort you home, young master.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.320
<i>Wh-Who's that?</i>

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.420
I told you not to come to my school.

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:08.830
I'm simply doing my duty as your maid.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:13.980
<i>So the rumor about him letting 
all his servants go was a lie.</i>

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.080
<i>But...</i>

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.300
I told you...

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.820
<i>She's suspicious!</i>

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:28.480
Could it be that you're embarrassed 
about the relationship we share?

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:34.240
<i>I-I-It sounds like she's talking about 
a special relationship of some sort!</i>

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:35.410
That's not it.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.030
<i>What is their relationship?!</i>

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.940
I'm just worried.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:40.780
Everyone's going to be mesmerized 
if they see a beautiful maid like you!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:44.130
That's why I don't want 
anyone else to see you!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.910
I-I see.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.380
<i>He's totally flattering her!</i>

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.040
<i>The maid seems to be liking it a bit, too.</i>

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.890
<i>There's no mistake.</i>

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:05.770
<i>This must be a forbidden romance 
between maid and master!</i>

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:10.950
Incidentally, young master,
I must apologize for this morning.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:11.480
<i>Yuuri-san must be in love with that maid!</i>

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.620
I should have been more careful.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.130
It's fine.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.950
It's not bugging me.

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:19.290
It's been a long break.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:25.210
I thought you might want to spend 
all your time together with me.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:29.180
<i>All... All your time together?!</i>

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:31.280
How lewd!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.660
<i>A man and woman mustn't be alone together!</i>

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:38.510
<i>Yuuri-san is still a child!</i>

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:41.520
<i>The master-servant relationship, 
the age gap...</i>

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:43.860
<i>It's all so taboo!</i>

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:49.190
<i>But that must be exactly what 
makes it so passionate. I know.</i>

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.330
<i>I've read a lot about it in books.</i>

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:53.060
Of course.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:56.220
I'd love to watch over you if I can.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:00.710
I've been thinking about you 
the whole time I've been at school.

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:03.530
I couldn't wait to see your face again.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:07.710
If I could, I'd be with you 24 hours a day.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:21.690
<i>What is this throbbing in my heart?</i>

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.510
<i>It's so powerful!</i>

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:28.550
<i>Yuuri-san still has his honest eyes.</i>

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:32.890
<i>No, his eyes when he looks at that maid...</i>

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.300
<i>They're even more honest.</i>

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:42.150
I was about to meddle.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:47.960
But I think I'd like to behold 
them for a while longer.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.490
Lady Tsukasa.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:54.030
How long must you keep the car waiting?

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.250
Sheesh.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.620
I've been looking for you.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:58.790
I'm sorry.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.510
I can explain...

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:10.650
What's wrong, Lilith?

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.050
So it was you.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.440
It's been a long time.

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:19.690
Gojouin Tsukasa-sama, correct?

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:21.360
Y-Yes.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:26.190
Thank you for taking care of Master Yuuri.

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:29.220
May I count on you to 
continue being his friend?

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.470
Y-Yes.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:34.240
I-I look forward to it.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.470
Thank you.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:38.430
Well, then, I must be going.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:40.180
Pardon me.

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.220
Are you acquainted?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.130
Yes, somewhat.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:53.010
She's a lovely person.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.300
Yes.

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.920
And so is her outfit.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.120
Hey, Fujisaki...

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.840
Could you wear an outfit like—

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.420
If I must do that, I will quit.

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:05.890
How was school, young master?

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:08.100
It was fun.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.800
Lunch was delicious, too.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:11.780
Is that so?

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:15.240
Although your cooking is still the best.

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:17.230
Thank you.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.600
Oh, we'll be having Hamburg 
steaks for dinner tonight.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.280
Really?

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.220
There.

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.400
That takes care of the cleaning.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.450
I haven't gone grocery 
shopping for dinner, though.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:43.550
I should hurry.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.830
I'm home.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.660
Lilith?

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.280
Lilith?

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:06.970
Lilith?

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.160
She must be hiding.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:14.510
There's no point in trying to surprise me.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.550
Give up and come out!

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.160
That's odd.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:23.690
Where could she have gone?

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.090
Shopping?

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.900
Well, whatever.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.690
If she's not here...

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.660
<b>Potato Chips</b>

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.660
<b>Lightly Salted</b>

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.660
<b><i>Demon Monthly</i></b>

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:35.870
I'm going to enjoy being 
alone until she gets home!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:42.910
Now, then...

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:45.490
What shall I make for dinner tonight?

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:47.330
It's fall now,

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:49.220
so maybe something that's in season...

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:52.610
Pumpkin, lotus root, sweet potato...

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:55.160
Matsutake mushrooms 
would be a bit expensive.

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:58.190
I know!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.440
Welcome, welcome!

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:02.870
We have some fresh ones today!

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.650
<b>Bass</b>

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.650
<b>Pigfish</b>

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:05.660
<i>Saury is the fish to have in the fall.</i>

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:09.410
<i>I'll make it a full course of saury.</i>

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.830
Welcome!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.710
What'll it be, miss?

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.380
May I have some saury?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.120
Shucks, sorry!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.600
I'm fresh out of saury.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.890
Oh, really?

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:27.340
It's hard to come by lately.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.020
And it sells out quick.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:33.240
I have some good bonito, though.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.090
What do you say?

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.490
No...

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:38.740
<i>Too bad.</i>

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.170
<i>I know.</i>

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:42.240
<i>I'll try another shop.</i>

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.070
<b>Saury</b>

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.030
<b>Saury</b>

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.030
<b>Sold Out</b>

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:52.460
They don't have it anywhere.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:56.500
<i>Maybe I should give up and 
make something else today.</i>

00:14:58.610 --> 00:14:59.470
<i>No.</i>

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:01.090
<i>I can't give up.</i>

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:04.790
<i>I want the young master 
to have a delicious meal.</i>

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.940
I know. I'll try the next town over.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.170
That was entertaining.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.020
Look at the time.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.970
Lilith's taking a while.

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.060
I wonder where she went.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:26.740
She could at least contact me 
if she's going to be late.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.650
It's gotten so dark already.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:41.080
I should hurry.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.580
<i>I never noticed how quiet it is without her.</i>

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.940
<i>Could it be something other than shopping?</i>

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:56.470
<i>Is she out for business 
she can't tell me about?</i>

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:01.280
<i>She always leaves a note when she goes out,</i>

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.000
<i>but she didn't leave one today.</i>

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:07.690
<i>Her cell phone number should be in here.</i>

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.200
<b>Young Master</b>

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.870
Why is her phone here?

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.040
I finally found some.

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:29.360
Now I can make a delicious 
meal for the young master.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.010
That's right...

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:35.370
It's gotten pretty late.

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.760
He might be worrying about me.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.010
I should contact him.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:41.690
Huh?

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:43.310
It's not here...

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:47.780
I may have left my phone at the mansion.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.470
I should hurry home.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.700
<i>She's not coming home.</i>

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:03.910
<i>This is my first time being home alone 
so late since Lilith came along.</i>

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:07.130
Lilith!

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:18.270
Oh, it's you.

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:23.870
That's the third one.

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.470
Yeah. This is bad.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:29.210
Delays caused by train car inspections?

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:31.070
Maybe I'll go get a drink.

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:32.990
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.700
<i>Now I can't get home.</i>

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.160
Sheesh.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.830
Whatever will I do with the young lady?

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.600
Demanding that I go buy 
her manga immediately...

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.540
<i>She just showed up one day out of nowhere.</i>

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:53.600
<i>I shouldn't be surprised 
if she leaves suddenly.</i>

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:57.850
<i>Besides, I'm better off without 
that suspicious maid anyway.</i>

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.080
Thank you. I owe you.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:09.410
Not at all. I just happened to be in the area.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:14.020
What were you doing in the next town over?

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:16.620
Shopping for dinner.

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:19.480
Couldn't you have bought 
it at your local shops?

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:20.520
Well...

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:24.020
I couldn't find the ingredients I needed.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.380
I see.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.840
When did you get here?

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:31.540
Last month.

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:35.250
Are you sure you want to be back here?

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.010
Yes.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:41.440
I see.

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:52.890
Thank you very much.

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:54.940
We should count on each 
other in times of need.

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:05.110
Young master...

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:16.100
I apologize for being late, 
and without contacting you.

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:18.630
Young master?

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.210
Have you cast a curse on me?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:29.230
A curse to make me sad 
when you aren't here?!

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:32.970
That must be it.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:36.780
I wasn't like this before you came here!

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.240
You must have!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:48.880
Even when the mansion was so empty, 
so dark, even when I was alone...

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:50.900
I was always fine.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:58.510
But now, I feel so lonely and 
isolated and anxious without you.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:02.110
What if you didn't come home?

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:05.140
I kept thinking about you 
even more than ever.

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:08.090
It's such a terrible curse!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:10.070
Young master...

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:16.820
With such a curse on me, 
I can't live without you!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:30.990
Yes, I did cast a curse on you,

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:34.360
so that you would become lonely.

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:37.990
And yet, you did well.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.280
You stayed at home by yourself.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:43.090
That's my master.

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:51.290
Don't go missing without 
telling me anymore.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:56.420
Understood, young master.

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:43.330
Thank you, Fujisaki!

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:47.060
I'm not your errand runner, young lady.

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:49.230
Sorry.

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:53.960
Hey, Fujisaki, could you 
please take a look at this?

00:22:55.450 --> 00:22:58.820
I think you should wear this outfit!

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:00.320
Come on, please?

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:03.890
Young lady...

00:23:03.890 --> 00:23:05.060
Yeah?

00:23:05.060 --> 00:23:07.060
I shall be leaving after today.

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:11.660
I'm sure it'll look good on you!

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:13.250
Please! Please!

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:16.860
Hey, wait! Fujisaki!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.950
<b>Next Time
Episode 4: Do You Like Pudding, Young Master?</b>
